WEBVTT

00:04.650 --> 00:07.525
Every Allen quarry has a posted Emergency Contacts

00:07.525 --> 00:10.237
sheet, and the same information is on your site's

00:10.237 --> 00:13.075
page on the Allen training site, where every number

00:13.075 --> 00:15.463
is tap-to-call. This video walks you through how

00:15.463 --> 00:16.387
to use it.

00:17.521 --> 00:21.333
Step one for any serious injury, fire or emergency:

00:21.333 --> 00:25.208
call 911. The card tells you exactly what to say:

00:25.208 --> 00:27.471
the site name and address, and where the injured

00:27.471 --> 00:30.646
person is, underground, pit, plant,

00:30.646 --> 00:34.071
scale or shop. Stay on the line and do what dispatch

00:34.071 --> 00:36.696
tells you. Any miner can make that call.

00:36.696 --> 00:39.170
If the injured person is underground,

00:39.170 --> 00:41.933
any miner can meet the ambulance at the portal,

00:41.933 --> 00:44.096
and the injured person comes out by the primary

00:44.096 --> 00:45.145
escapeway.

00:46.291 --> 00:49.516
Step two: call mine command, starting at the top

00:49.516 --> 00:52.353
of the list for your site, until you reach someone.

00:52.353 --> 00:54.666
They'll send a person to meet the ambulance and

00:54.666 --> 00:57.016
they'll make the required notifications.

00:58.178 --> 01:00.928
For a death, an injury that could cause death,

01:00.928 --> 01:03.678
an entrapment, or other serious accidents,

01:03.678 --> 01:07.303
the company must notify MSHA within 15 minutes.

01:07.303 --> 01:09.478
That's the job of mine management, but you should

01:09.478 --> 01:12.028
know it exists, so tell them right away.

01:13.158 --> 01:16.058
The card also lists mine rescue, the Kentucky mine

01:16.058 --> 01:19.983
safety office, MSHA, and explosives contacts.

01:19.983 --> 01:22.146
Management uses these, but knowing they're there

01:22.146 --> 01:23.896
helps in an emergency.

01:25.082 --> 01:27.745
Finally, the card shows the nearest hospitals with

01:27.745 --> 01:30.607
directions, and your site's gathering points.

01:31.734 --> 01:35.009
911 first, say where you are and where the injured

01:35.009 --> 01:37.959
person is, then mine command. Know your gathering

01:37.959 --> 01:39.996
point. Keep the card handy.

01:41.112 --> 01:44.274
Remember: your site's plans and procedures always

01:44.274 --> 01:45.774
override this video.
